  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkikompe naimina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee eitanap olaitasheikinoni lenye le nkaji enye ajoki, “Imputa ilbenia le lelo tung'ana endaa, tipika enaba anaa enaidim ake ninche aatanap, nipik impisai e pooki tungani enkutuk olbene lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipik enkikompe ai ina kikompe enkosholai enkutuk olbene lo loti tenebo impisai enyena naainosie ilpaek.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas anaa enaitanapa Yosef ninye. Ore ake pee ekenyu, neishori iltung'ana epuo aareu isirkon lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee epuo aalamari penyo aalam enkanasa, nejoki Yosef olaitasheikinoni le nkaji, enye, “Inyo, tusuja lelo tung'ana, ore ake pee inepu, tiaaki ninche, ‘Ainyoo pee itushukutuo entorrono te sidai? Ainyo pee itupurroitie enkikompe ai enkosholai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aime ena kikompe oshi eokishore olkitok lai, naa te ninye eibonisho? Itaasa entorroni teina nitaasa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee einepu ninche, neirorie ninche lelo rorei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche ninye, “Ainyoo pee eiro olkitok lang irorei laijo kulo? Metalama isinkan linono ina aaku keidim aataas embae naijo ina! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'ura, ore inapa pisai nikinotito too nkutukie oo lbenia lang, kitushukutuo aashukoki iyie king'ua enkop e Kanaan; kaji naa kinko siake tinikipurroo enkosholai arashu sahabu te nkaji olkitok lino? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inchoo ake obo lang too sinkan linono otumi eeta, enchoo eye, nikiaku sii iyiook pooki irrindiki lo lkitok lang.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Enchoo naa eaku anaa enitejo; ore ake olotumi eeta neaku orrindik lai, ore ilkulikae linyi pooki neaku meeta entioto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesioki pooki ng'ae aitadou olbene lenye enkop, nebol pooki tung'ani olbene lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'oru te pooki eiteru to lbotor neitabayie to loti; netumi enkikompe to lbene le Benchamen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepolos pooki inkilani enye, neirot pooki ng'ae esikiria enye, nerrinyo aapuo enkanasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee elotu Yuda o lalashera lenyena enkaji e Yosef, eton ake etii Yosef ine; nebatata te dukuya ninye aabatatakino enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yosef ninche, “Kaa bae ena nikintaasa? Aimiyiololo aajo ore oltung'ani laijo nanu naa kaidim aibonisho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Yuda, “Kaa taa kijoki olkitok lang? Ainyoo taa kiro aajo? Anaa kaji kinko tinikilaku ate? Enoto Enkai entorroni oo sinkan linono; ng'ura, kira iyiook irrindiki lo lkitok lang, iyiook pooki ometabaiki lido duoo linotie enkikompe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etejo, “Meidimayu te nanu mataasa ina! Oltung'ani ake onotieki enkikompe ninye ake oaku orrindik lai; kake ore intae, enchom te seriani enetii papaai linyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etasaishe Yuda te nkaraki Benchamen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee elo Yuda enetii ninye nejoki, “Oi olkitok lang, inchoo osinka lino eiro, aatasayia, kaliki ororei enkiok o lkitok lai, nimincho engoro ino eyupuyup to sinka lino; amu itiu doi iyie anaa Farao enkorrok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eikilikuana apa olkitok lai isinkan lenyena ajoki, ‘Iyatata papaai linyi anaa likae alashe?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikiwal apa aajoki olkitok lang, ‘Kiata papa, naa olpayian kitok oleng, nikiata sii olalashe lang, oti olotioiwuoki te moruao enye, netua apa olalashe lenye, neaku ninye ake etung'uayioki too nkera e ng'otonye; naa kenyor menye ninye oleng.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintoki ajoki isinkan linono, ‘Eyau ninye ene natii, pee adol ninye too nkonyek aainei.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikijoki olkitok lang, ‘Meidim enkayioni atung'uai menye, amu tenelo aing'uaa menye, naa keye menye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee ijoki isinkan linono, ‘Pooki ake pee intokiki aadol enkomom ai, tenelotu olalashe linyi oti tenebo intae.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore pee kirrinyo enetii osinka lino, aa papa, nikiliki irorei lo lkitok lang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ejo papaai lang, ‘Enchom enyaaki enyang'aki iyiook enkiti daa;’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikijo, ‘Mikipuo katukul. Tenaa keiriamariyie iyiook olalashe lang oti naa aikipuo; amu mikindim katukul aatodol enkomom eilo tung'ani arashu ake kiata olalashe lang oti tenebo iyiook.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee ejoki iyiook osinka lino papaai lang, ‘Iyiololo apa aajo aatoikio enkitok ai ilayiok oare; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore obo naatung'uayie nanu, ina pee ajo, esipa etumutaki apa aaitaa ndung'udung'ot, neitu aekata aitoki adol ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinintokiki sii taata aaya ele aaitung'uaa nanu nelo netum enyamali e nkitamioto niyauu ilpapit laainei ooibor to sina enemeneng'a.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata, ore tenalotu enetii osinka lino papaai lang, nemetii enkayioni tenebo iyiook, neaku ore enkishui enye neibung'are ena ayioni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore pee edol ajo metii enkayioni tenebo iyiook, neye ninye, neyau isinkan linono ilpapit ooibor lo sinka lino papaai lang to sina enemeneng'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etaa osinka lino oloitasheiki enkishui enkayioni, te papaai lang ejoki. ‘Teneitu ashuku ninye enitii, naaku oloota entorroni te dukuya papaai te nkishui ai pooki,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "metaa, ore naa taata, inchoo osinka lino, aatasayia, ejing erishata enkayioni aaku orrindik lo lkitok lai; nincho enkayioni eshuko tenebo ilalashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kaji naa aikunari tenarrinyokino papaai lai marikito enkayioni? Ekaure doi ninye ajo atoduaa intorrok naajing'aki papaai lai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
